              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akuma barbaadi ibidaa ch'ile bobeesu, yokhaani qoraanileeni ibida bobeesani, nami d'ibaani deemuleeni woldida owisa.",
